# Text is checked out with LF everywhere: files embedded in the binary must be
# the same bytes on Windows as in CI, or a local build cannot confirm a release.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sig text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
installer/S01xkeen-panel-guard text eol=lf
installer/S98xkeen-service-cards text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.go text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.jpg binary
*.png binary
